{"title":"Kart Royale","rating":50,"scr":{"score":70,"reason":"Both gameplay frames show coherent stylized golden-hour art: banked tarmac with aggregate detail, red-white kerbs, grass/crowd/props trackside, glossy chunky karts with drivers, full kart-racer HUD. Composition is dynamic with strong sense of speed. Deducted for low-poly blocky crowd, flat distant foliage, dark crushed tarmac, and heavy blur obscuring detail in drift shot. Good polished indie look, not photoreal AAA."}}
